,0.072,0.04,0.02,0.034,0.024,0.047,0.003,0.0,0.001,0.0,0.001,0.001,0.002],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"Mr. Thacker peers over his shoulder at you, adjusting a pair of half-moon glasses on his nose. \"Not interested. Either in sailing or adventure any more. Even pirates like you use chronometers and your bloody smartphones for everything. No challenge in it. Harder to find your way around the city than the bloody ocean now.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.288,"end":21.44,"frac":0.964,"status":"ok","matched":54,"words":56},"large":{"start":0.288,"end":21.44,"frac":0.964,"status":"ok","matched":54,"words":56},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"You smirk, then take out the tiny, precious treasure map and hold it up to him.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":21.984,"end":26.528,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":16},"large":{"start":21.984,"end":26.528,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":16},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"He pushes his glasses up his nose and snatches it off you. \"What's this? That's a terrible map. Barely readable. No measurements of longitude. Doesn't even have a compass rose, just a measure of prevailing winds. You'd be mad trying to follow this.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":27.328,"end":43.84,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":43,"words":43},"large":{"start":27.328,"end":43.84,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":43,"words":43},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"You shrug. That’s not the first time you’ve been called mad, and it won’t be the last.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":44.224,"end":48.576,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":17},"large":{"start":44.224,"end":48.576,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":17},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"\"It would be quite the challenge…Very well, I will meet you on the ship, Captain. I’ll find my own way there.”","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":49.216,"end":56.864,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":22},"large":{"start":49.216,"end":56.84,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":22},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"As Mr. Thacker walks to your ship, you can’t help but admire the “spyglass”. You should take a photo of it to add to your pirate coat of arms. Lean into the symbolism around clear vision and whatnot.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":57.28,"end":69.9,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":38},"large":{"start":57.28,"end":69.74,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":38},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"⚠️ Don't forget, download each photo right after you take it, or risk losing that masterpiece to the digital deep.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92c906aa9d_crest_v2.png"}